**Reference scope:** architecture
**Status:** DIAGNOSTIC MODEL COORDINATES ONLY / NOT A COMPOUNDING FORMULA

Immediate recipe predecessor: unchanged Astra V1. Use the separately bound V1 mass-faithful model projection for the pre-mix comparison. Every dose change is a deliberate development proposal, not a change of stock strength.
Source mass ledger: docs/research/Prada_LHomme_Intense_Astra_V2_accounting.json.
This is an original inspired study of Prada L'Homme Intense, not a brand recipe.
Coordinate q_i = raw stock mass in mg divided by the repository material-density number. The model multiplies q_i by stock fraction and that same density to recover supplied-product grams. These coordinates are NOT measured stock volumes. The displayed density in the matrix table is an artificial unit conversion, NOT a physical measurement. All volume-based gates and stock receipts remain subject to this limitation. An unsupported Intense contract must remain unresolved; do not add original-Prada neroli or pepper.

